    'presence.forums.saudi.loc1': 'Jeddah, Saudi Arabia',
    'presence.forums.saudi.loc2': 'Jeddah Superdome',
    'presence.forums.saudi.loc3': 'October 21–22, 2026',
    'presence.forums.saudi.p1': 'The Mercosur Chamber of Commerce has confirmed that its President, Erik Aaron Lara Riveros, is registered to participate in the Saudi Maritime & Logistics Congress 2026, to be held at Jeddah Superdome, Saudi Arabia, on October 21 and 22, 2026.',
    'presence.forums.saudi.p2': 'Saudi Maritime & Logistics Congress 2026 is one of the leading B2B gatherings for the maritime and logistics sector in Saudi Arabia, with an agenda focused on shipping, ports, logistics, infrastructure, technology, supply chains, investment and the transformation of global trade.',
    'presence.forums.saudi.p3': 'The event\'s location in Jeddah reinforces its strategic relevance within the maritime and logistics ecosystem of the Red Sea, in connection with trade corridors between the Middle East, Asia, Africa, Europe and other international markets. Jeddah Islamic Port is a key infrastructure for Saudi foreign trade and regional logistics connectivity.',
    'presence.forums.saudi.p4': 'The Chamber\'s presence will allow it to explore sectoral links in international logistics, port infrastructure, maritime transport, supply chains and global trade between Latin America, the Middle East, Asia and other international markets.',
    'presence.forums.saudi.area1': 'International logistics',
    'presence.forums.saudi.area2': 'Port infrastructure',
    'presence.forums.saudi.area3': 'Maritime transport',
    'presence.forums.saudi.area4': 'Supply chains',
    'presence.forums.saudi.area5': 'Global trade',
    'presence.forums.saudi.area6': 'Latin America–Middle East relations',
    'presence.forums.saudi.area7': 'Interregional connectivity',
    'presence.forums.unctad.title': 'UNCTAD World Investment Forum 2026',
    'presence.forums.unctad.loc1': 'Doha, Qatar',
    'presence.forums.unctad.loc2': 'Sheraton Convention Center',
    'presence.forums.unctad.loc3': '25 to 27 October 2026',
    'presence.forums.unctad.p1': 'The Mercosur Chamber of Commerce will participate in UN Trade and Development\'s (UNCTAD) World Investment Forum 2026, through its President, Erik Aaron Lara Riveros, at the event to be held in Doha, Qatar, from 25 to 27 October 2026.',
    'presence.forums.unctad.p2': 'The World Investment Forum is one of the world\'s leading forums for investment, development, financing, public policy, business and sustainability. Its 2026 edition will bring together policymakers, international institutions, investors, business leaders, financial institutions, development organizations and stakeholders involved in sustainable, resilient and inclusive investment.',
    'presence.forums.unctad.p3': 'The Chamber\'s participation strengthens its international agenda in investment, financing, productive development, value chains, infrastructure, innovation, sustainability and business cooperation, connecting the MERCOSUR area and Latin America with a global platform for discussion and action on investment for development.',
    'presence.forums.unctad.area1': 'International investment',
