    'presence.forums.iberoamericano.sub': 'Ibero-American Business Meeting',
    'presence.forums.iberoamericano.loc1': 'Madrid, Spain',
    'presence.forums.iberoamericano.loc2': 'November 3–4, 2026',
    'presence.forums.iberoamericano.p1': 'The Mercosur Chamber of Commerce has confirmed that its President, Erik Aaron Lara Riveros, is registered to participate in the XVI Encuentro Empresarial Iberoamericano, to be held in Madrid, Spain, on November 3 and 4, 2026.',
    'presence.forums.iberoamericano.p2': 'The Encuentro Empresarial Iberoamericano is held within the framework of the Ibero-American Summit and constitutes one of the main public-private dialogue spaces in the Ibero-American region, articulating the vision of the business sector, institutional priorities and the structural challenges of the regional economy.',
    'presence.forums.iberoamericano.p3': 'The Madrid 2026 edition takes place in the context of the XXX Ibero-American Summit of Heads of State and Government, scheduled in Madrid for November 4 and 5, 2026. The business meeting addresses central matters for Ibero-American competitiveness, including productive transformation, public-private cooperation, innovation, the knowledge economy, entrepreneurial ecosystems, inclusion and enabling conditions for development.',
    'presence.forums.iberoamericano.p4': 'The Chamber\'s presence will strengthen its Ibero-American agenda on trade, investment, business cooperation, productive development, value chains, innovation and institutional relations among Latin America, the MERCOSUR sphere, Spain, Portugal and other strategic actors in the Ibero-American space.',
    'presence.forums.iberoamericano.area1': 'Ibero-American business dialogue',
